      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup\n\n1. Create credentials:\n   - **Ghost Admin API**: Blog URL + API Key + JWT Secret\n   - **Qwen TTS API Key**: Bearer token for your Qwen proxy\n   - **Bunny CDN API Key**: AccessKey for Bunny CDN\n\n2. Set environment variables:\n   - `QWEN_TTS_BASE_URL` — your Qwen proxy base URL\n   - `QWEN_TTS_MODEL` — model name (default: qwen-tts)\n   - `BUNNY_PULL_ZONE` — your Bunny CDN pull zone name\n\n3. Activate workflow and test with Manual Trigger",
        "color": 3,
        "width": 550,
        "height": 300
      }
    },
